<title>BELGIUM: EU clears Wagons-Lits/Carlson deal.</title>
<headline>EU clears Wagons-Lits/Carlson deal.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-03-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>The European Commission has cleared a plan by French travel company Wagons-Lits et du Tourisme SA, which belongs to Accor SA, and Carlson Travel Group Inc to merge their worldwide business travel services, a company source told Reuters on Tuesday.  </p>
<p>&quot;The Commission took a favourable decision without putting any conditions,&quot; an official at Carlson Wagonlit Travel, the two partners already existing joint company, said.</p>
<p>The Commission is expected to make an official announcement later today. -- Brussels newsroom 322 2876841</p>
